WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.822
The screener starts with an example: large companies growing fast or paying a dividend.

2
00:00:05.822 --> 00:00:09.663
Choose the universe: stocks, ETFs, REITs or all.

3
00:00:09.663 --> 00:00:15.157
Add a filter. Each one has a field, a condition and a value.

4
00:00:15.157 --> 00:00:19.328
Results update as you type, with every metric explained.

5
00:00:19.328 --> 00:00:23.500
Groups combine filters with match all or match any.

6
00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:30.315
The address bar is always a shareable link. Name the screen and save it to your workspace.
